<title>USA: Charter Oak has 5.7 pct Dick Clark stake.</title>
<headline>Charter Oak has 5.7 pct Dick Clark stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Charter Oak Partners, a Westport Connecticut investor, said it has taken a 5.7 percent stake, or 433,700 common shares, in Dick Clark Productions Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission filed Friday, Charter Oak said it most recently acquired 66,300 shares between April and June 16 at $12.31 to $12.81 a share.</p>
<p>Charter Oak said it holds shares in Dick Clark, a Burbank, Calif., motion picture company, for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
